This repository is a fork of SPL Governance, upstream tag governance-v3.1.2.

Required by section 4(b) of the License. The fork changes one program file:

  program/src/tools/spl_token.rs
      assert_is_valid_spl_token_mint accepts a Token-2022 mint carrying a
      TransferFeeConfig extension, by unpacking through
      PodStateWithExtensions::<PodMint> before falling back to the stock
      valid_mint_length check. Stock SPL Governance rejects such mints with
      custom error 548 (SplTokenInvalidMintAccountData).

Package renaming and workspace manifests are also changed; they are outside
the program-source allowlist. Pristine upstream sources are vendored under
upstream/. scripts/check-upstream-diff.sh fails if any other program/src file
diverges.
